abstract: >-
  Code for the paper "Correlation Clustering of Bird Sounds" (GCPR 2023): training of
  siamese and classification networks on spectrograms of xeno-canto recordings, and
  correlation clustering of bird sound recordings by greedy additive edge contraction
  and Kernighan-Lin, and the experiments of the paper.
